- Approved work output, where applicable.

### Calculation examples

Daily wage:

Approved payable days × agreed daily rate.

Hourly wage:

Approved payable hours × agreed hourly rate.

Piece-rate:

Approved quantity × agreed piece-rate.

Show calculation breakdowns.

Never use unverified attendance in final payroll.

### Site transfer handling

A worker may move from Site A to Site B during the payroll period.

Allocate wage cost to the correct project/site using approved assignment and attendance history.

Do not allocate the full monthly wage to the final site automatically.

